        "# Machine Learning Lab\n",
        "#sapna bai\n",
        "#24F-AI-150\n",
        "# Open Ended Lab\n",
        "\n",
        "## Health Risk Classification\n",
        "\n",
        "In this lab, we build a model that predicts whether a patient is likely to have diabetes based on health indicators such as glucose, BMI, age, and blood pressure. We use the Pima Indians Diabetes Database, preprocess the data, and apply two classifiers: Support Vector Machine (SVM) and Decision Tree. Finally, we compare both models and discuss overfitting and accuracy trade-offs."
      ],
